kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "package-tui-engine"
purpose: "Core TUI engine APIs for packages/xylitol-tui (Container, OverlayHandle, optional image surface)."
valid_scope[2]: "packages/xylitol-tui/",tests/
requirements[6]{req_id,title,statement}:
  pte01,"container-vertical-stack","The xylitol-tui package MUST provide a Container component that holds an ordered list of child Components, renders by concatenating each child's render(width) lines in order, invalidates all children on invalidate, and does NOT automatically fan out InputEvent to children (focus routing remains the TUI / host responsibility). Container MUST expose add_child, remove_child, and clear."
  pte02,"overlay-handle","TUI::show_overlay MUST return an OverlayHandle that can hide (permanently remove), set_hidden / is_hidden (temporary), and report is_focused. hide MUST restore focus via the focus-restore state machine (topmost visible capturing overlay, else pre_focus FocusTarget after retarget). The handle MUST remain usable only while the overlay entry exists (operations after hide are no-ops)."
  pte03,"overlay-handle-focus-controls","OverlayHandle MUST expose focus and unfocus operations. focus MUST bring a visible overlay (including non_capturing) to the visual front and capture input. unfocus MUST release focus without rebuild; unfocus MAY accept an explicit FocusTarget. TUI MUST implement eligible/blocked/resume overlay focus-restore and reclaim on dispatch_event when focus is not on an overlay."
  pte04,"image-surface-optional","The package MUST NOT require the Image component or full terminal_image encode path for the primary agent_demo / app-shell wiring. is_image_line (and any minimal helpers the width invariant needs) MUST remain. Unused image encode/UI surface MAY be removed or feature-gated."
  pte05,"input-listener-pre-focus",TUI MUST 提供 add_input_listener / remove_input_listener；每个 InputEvent 在路由到 focused overlay 或 focused root child 之前 MUST 按注册顺序调用 listener；任一 listener 返回 Consumed MUST 阻止后续 listener 与焦点组件接收该事件。
  pte06,"overlay-focus-restore-sm","TUI MUST maintain overlay focus-restore state inactive/eligible/blocked；当 capturing overlay 获焦时 MUST 进入 eligible；当焦点被临时转到非祖先 root/child 时 MUST 进入 blocked；dispatch_event 在 listener 之后 MUST reclaim eligible 或满足条件的 blocked resume；set_focus(None) 在 clear 策略下 MUST 清除 restore；non_capturing show 与 set_hidden(false) MUST NOT 自动抢焦点。"
scenarios[12]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  pte01,"container-concatenates-children",a Container holds Text(a) then Text(b),render(width) is called,the output lines are a then b in order
  pte01,"container-does-not-fanout-input",a Container has a child Input,Container.handle_input receives a Key event,the child Input does not receive the event unless the host/TUI focused that child directly
  pte02,"overlay-hide-restores-prefocus",capturing overlay focused over root editor,OverlayHandle.hide,focus returns to editor pre_focus
  pte03,"overlay-focus-nc-allowed",visible non_capturing overlay,OverlayHandle.focus,overlay is focused and receives subsequent input
  pte03,"overlay-unfocus-no-reclaim",capturing overlay focused,unfocus then dispatch_event,root keeps focus; overlay does not reclaim
  pte04,"agent-demo-builds-without-image","the xylitol-tui package is built with default features","agent_demo and cargo test -p xylitol-tui run",they succeed without depending on the Image component API
  pte05,"listener-consumes-before-focus",已注册对 ctrl+c 返回 Consumed 的 listener，且 Editor 处于焦点,调用 dispatch_event(Key(ctrl+c)),Editor 不收到该事件
  pte05,"listener-yields-to-focus",listener 对普通字符返回 Continue，Editor 处于焦点,调用 dispatch_event(Key(a)),Editor 收到该事件
  pte05,"paste-through-listeners",listener 对 Paste 返回 Continue,调用 dispatch_event(Paste(...)),焦点组件收到 paste
  pte06,"reclaim-after-set-focus-steal",capturing overlay visible,set_focus root then dispatch_event,overlay reclaims focus and receives the event
  pte06,"set-focus-none-clears",overlay focused with eligible restore,set_focus None,restore inactive and overlay does not reclaim on next input
  pte06,"nested-retarget-on-hide",parent then child capturing overlays,hide child,focus restores to parent via retargeted pre_focus
